
/ The instructions say the tape must be positioned on
/ the first non-zero byte.  I have adjusted the DCA
/ accordingly.
/ Press Start, turn the tape on, then press Continue 4
/ times.  When the reader stops, the computer may be
/ started at 07600 to clear memory, or the BIN or RIM
/ loaders may be used.

	*0030
START,	HLT             / Misdocumented as OSR
	KRB             / Read character 0000abcdefgh
	RTR             / g hL0000abcdef
	RAR             / f ghL0000abcde
	DCA 0027        / Store an instruction
	ISZ .-1         / Store next after, use f as L
	JMP START       / Go again
*START  / Starting address
$
